  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1301.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1301.02 Applicability. The rules in this chapter shall apply to:\n\n(a) Unlined municipal solid waste landfills, owned by New Hampshire municipalities and closed after July 1, 1984; and\n\n(b) Municipal incinerators identified in RSA 149-M:42, IV.\n\nSource. #6095, eff 9-26-95; ss by #7492, eff 5-18-01; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1300); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3001.02); ss by #10599, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13622, eff 5-1-23",
